Subject: [PATCH 1/4] World 3D S2: open-world tile export, on-demand build and
 cache

- scripts/scene/export-tile.mjs: one ADT tile of a map as a scene
  (<x>_<y>.glb + .scene.json) with the instance scene exporter unchanged;
  tile maths (tileBounds, tileAt, tileWindow); ocean tiles marked .empty
- scripts/export-world-tiles.mjs + npm run extract:world (--tile / --around)
- scripts/scene/world-tile-worker.mjs + src/world-tiles.ts: tiles built in
  a child process on first request and cached under assets/world/v1/<map>/
  (WOWMIN_WORLD_TILE_DIR); WOWMIN_WORLD3D_TILES window size (odd 1-7, 3)
- src/web-server.ts: GET /assets/world/<map>/<x>_<y>.glb | .scene.json
- scripts/test-world-tiles.cjs; assets/world/ ignored

